      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "There appears to be a bug in Unity with `LayerCullSpherical`, not specifically the `LayerCullDistances`. It seems to apply entirely bogus culling on specifically UI elements. If I keep that value as `false` in the given world everything works as it should.\n\nWe may need to disable this option for the time being and turn it into a no-op behind Udon. Any thoughts from community side?",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
