  "details": "When changing culling distances chat boxes start behaving weirdly and stop rendering after moving a certain distance away from what i assume is the origin point, instead of using the actual distance from the physical chatbox position to camera.\n\nTo test this issue, I have been using the world Illumination Media Player, chatboxes are visible in the spawn hallway areas, but when teleporting to the bedrooms / observatory, they are no longer visible.\n\nFrom extra testing, it seems like the chat boxes are tied to the Player / PlayerLocal layers, having these both set to 0 (Use Far Clip) makes the chat boxes work again, however this doesn't explain why its not based on the physical chatbox position but instead on the distance away from origin.",
